# armour/shared/pauldron_shard6_l: the legend SHARD pauldron on the left shoulder (shard.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# knapped shards grown to the legend size: three blade-like flakes leaning out over a faceted cop, the long one
# 4 px over it, the facets in hard planes; a lame below (KNAPPED, obsidian).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the lame's lip, N the seam under the cop, P the flakes and the facets.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron shard.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

